# ---------- docs ----------
(root/'RELIEVER_REQUEST_UPDATE.md').write_text('''# Reliever Request Update\n\n- Guard and Supervisor have a Reliever Request page.\n- Request fields: Name, Staff ID, Location Code, request type (Holiday / Medical / Illness / Emergency), from date, to date, reason.\n- Admin/Master Admin have a Reliever Requests page.\n- Pending requests can be approved/rejected. Approval requires an active staff member marked as Reliever at the same location.\n- Approved request stores reliever ID, name and location.\n- In-app notifications are created for requester and assigned reliever. WhatsApp sending uses the existing WhatsApp Cloud API configuration when available; otherwise no automatic WhatsApp message is sent.\n''',encoding='utf-8')
